---
title: "syncLegionAddresses (Shared across sale types)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_fetch: authorized
    q_fetch --> q_update: fetch latest addresses from LegionAddressRegistry
    q_update --> [*]: update local legionFeeRecipient, legionSigner, legionBouncer, emit AddressesSynced

    note right of q_fetch
        INV-001: pulls addresses from central registry (single source of truth)
        INV-002: only Legion operators can trigger sync
        INV-003: updated addresses apply to subsequent operations
    end note
